  "clips": [
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c1",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        0
      ],
      "text": "The guards went still when Melos spoke.",
      "text_sha256": "04b3461842b3e6417a7a8005956f1dc57d3d161f41c5bd427b960461ec97757d",
      "word_count": 7,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c2",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "melos",
      "speaker": "melos",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:melos",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "text": "\"You kill people without a fair trial,\"",
      "text_sha256": "5ec185ff0d87c194dc69f6aad78df8baf2f74425f010549b872be4f92b835ca6",
      "word_count": 7,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c2.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c3",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "text": "he told the ruler.",
      "text_sha256": "043a02c8cfb9a21e96a343b26d80257cddbf6160d01383eb959053298ca3a72e",
      "word_count": 4,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c3.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c4",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "melos",
      "speaker": "melos",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:melos",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        1
      ],
      "text": "\"A man only has to frighten you, and you order his death.\"",
      "text_sha256": "b02a5d82b6361ad539d35f4eb65526f95e3669fd4163886d6258663cba8bbdae",
      "word_count": 12,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c4.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c5",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        2,
        3
      ],
      "text": "Dust covered the shepherd's sandals. He stood alone before the ruler, trying not to show his fear. The ruler's eyes narrowed.",
      "text_sha256": "399066f72265b1b64ee5e74e3b443b903ab6b6f19b96424d3e89e46cc7fb512f",
      "word_count": 21,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c5.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c6",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "king",
      "speaker": "king",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:king",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        3
      ],
      "text": "\"Then you shall die as well.\"",
      "text_sha256": "f7d19588274f11e2f686edbe727fd80f5c310042214311abd5a8c5998cdf6d99",
      "word_count": 6,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c6.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c7",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        4
      ],
      "text": "Melos's stomach tightened.",
      "text_sha256": "d23d152cc543910ef63e84f4118bcff5df71c40fb77397dca7547209b98a0543",
      "word_count": 3,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c7.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c8",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "melos",
      "speaker": "melos",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:melos",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "text": "\"Give me three days,\"",
      "text_sha256": "8da977f1e7329aa240c434ec6934362e788ca0d9cde1fa34284e009fecab6c11",
      "word_count": 4,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c8.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c9",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "text": "he said.",
      "text_sha256": "0669e82b2925c89aa39333900dd53b5eddf64c21d53190788d892d0e0af37799",
      "word_count": 2,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c9.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c10",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "melos",
      "speaker": "melos",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:melos",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "text": "\"My sister is getting married. Let me attend her wedding. Then I will return.\"",
      "text_sha256": "ef3e508956fd64409ea8aaa886649fce9ec12989ffc3bedb37f53d87a5642ee8",
      "word_count": 14,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c10.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c11",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "king",
      "speaker": "king",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:king",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "text": "\"To your own execution?\"",
      "text_sha256": "7317685634b609ec1dd4826fe7776272593e204a6c20ec3fb918e6a426306342",
      "word_count": 4,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c11.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c12",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        6
      ],
      "text": "The ruler laughed.",
      "text_sha256": "5b57d23a2b31835f31de2474cff9640924aaf82c923d3072ff3d3db636b642b0",
      "word_count": 3,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c12.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c13",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "melos",
      "speaker": "melos",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:melos",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "text": "\"My friend will stay in my place.\"",
      "text_sha256": "57d48def24b09063d9213cbcf8547373f6698c4e004bf7fd9c11859529585672",
      "word_count": 7,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c13.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c14",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        8
      ],
      "text": "His friend stepped forward without a word. The ruler studied them both, as though searching for a trick.",
      "text_sha256": "ef9cd1efbceb2c16f9ab2816b3630f7619b2b8337af9c6c5beb2c57f4ada519b",
      "word_count": 18,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c14.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c15",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "king",
      "speaker": "king",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:king",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "text": "\"Before sunset on the third day,\"",
      "text_sha256": "6b22a770cfcaa2fad822f83d31bfae04a0ba39129c0ffecac33959126a951fab",
      "word_count": 6,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c15.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c16",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "text": "he said at last.",
      "text_sha256": "9da4229724b760634cb95fe029597661d252350eb1334c07f5064cf411a3c655",
      "word_count": 4,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c16.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c17",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "king",
      "speaker": "king",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:king",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "text": "\"If you are late, your friend dies.\"",
      "text_sha256": "825833d161bff93e651d9c47bd7a73f3ce1b1e8599dfcd2028bbbda122605231",
      "word_count": 7,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c17.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c18",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        10
      ],
      "text": "His friend took Melos's hand. His fingers were warm and steady.",
      "text_sha256": "a88c04acf380da5e138ce45869d9d7a26251a962192a1b6469b452047aa9bf4d",
      "word_count": 11,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c18.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c19",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "friend",
      "speaker": "friend",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:friend",
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "text": "\"Go. I'll wait.\"",
      "text_sha256": "ab181b2f97452789e2b71179a310f304b74769e079d46f7a983e189b356fe11b",
      "word_count": 3,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c19.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part1_c20",
      "part": 1,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        12,
        13
      ],
      "text": "At the wedding, Melos smiled whenever his sister smiled. He watched her join hands with her husband, but every shadow crossing the floor drew his eyes toward the door. Time was passing. Before dawn on the third day, he set out for the city.",
      "text_sha256": "0f8ba2315125b68392f4b8eb23834af68a587413f8f752fdf5a4b5c6e8b58ee8",
      "word_count": 44,
      "split_reason": "comment_or_scene_boundary(呼び出し側指定のforce_split_before_paragraphs)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part1_c20.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c1",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        14,
        15,
        16,
        17,
        18,
        19
      ],
      "text": "At the river, he stopped. The bridge was gone. Brown water rushed through the empty crossing, carrying broken branches. Rain had turned the river into a flood. Melos searched along the banks, but there was no other way across. He stepped into the water. The current swept his feet away. Muddy water filled his mouth. He fought toward the far bank, reached for a passing branch, and caught it. Holding tight, he dragged himself ashore. He rose, shaking, and ran.",
      "text_sha256": "90b5776170f2e3d8f747cdb34eb5a29e59dfddcce04524b37c5b6ef08b9da86b",
      "word_count": 80,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避); word_count_guideline_auto_split(前半、元186語がhard_avoid_words=150語を超過したため最も近い段落境界で自動分割)",
      "warnings": [
        "auto_split_hard_avoid_exceeded(original_word_count=186)"
      ],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part2_c1.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part2_c2",
      "part": 2,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        20,
        21,
        22,
        23,
        24,
        25,
        26,
        27
      ],
      "text": "Beyond the river, attackers blocked the road. One grabbed his arm. Another swung a stick. Melos struck out, broke free, and stumbled past them. Their angry shouts followed him, but he did not look back. By afternoon, pain filled every step. Then his legs gave way. He lay with his face against the earth. The city was still far away. He could not reach it. He could not even stand. He could stay here. No one would find him before sunset. His friend would die, but he would live. For one terrible moment, the thought brought relief. Then he remembered those warm fingers around his hand.",
      "text_sha256": "3425667b02e049a9f2b2dc1f03a93fac10069d0dba49049c4d4676aba31e4061",
      "word_count": 106,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避); word_count_guideline_auto_split(後半、元186語がhard_avoid_words=150語を超過したため最も近い段落境界で自動分割)",
      "warnings": [
