      "speaker": "friend",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:friend",
      "paragraph_index": 41,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        41
      ],
      "text": "\"But you came.\"",
      "text_sha256": "aa9bf90c054b1d7b1eab8dd610add0d8ee6eb11f72a8dbfde5a245c0182bfd0f",
      "word_count": 3,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part3_c8.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c9",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "narrator",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "voice_role": "narrator",
      "paragraph_index": 42,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        42
      ],
      "text": "The ruler stared at their joined hands. At last, he ordered the guards to release them both.",
      "text_sha256": "df20b5a6a20c66ac8eb8b8147feafc52097b415380c82bed6c2b859dff7bbbb1",
      "word_count": 17,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part3_c9.wav"
    },
    {
      "id": "full_story_part3_c10",
      "part": 3,
      "voice": "king",
      "speaker": "king",
      "voice_role": "dialogue:king",
      "paragraph_index": 43,
      "source_paragraph_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "text": "\"I believed every man would save himself,\"",
      "text_sha256": "c8c3676bc569eed8908aa6ba37d79588ce87c8766d2c470a52237c351012406e",
      "word_count": 7,
      "split_reason": "voice_boundary(分割不可避)",
      "warnings": [],
      "narration_path": "er026_output/family_z_production_e2e_01/melos/run_e2e_01/b1b/narration/full_story_part3_c10.wav"
